title
  Minimal Example

output
	Your [pack] contains [item], [item] and [item].
	
item 
	some coins
	an old {silver|bronze} ring
	a handkerchief
	a shard of bone
	some lint
	a tin of tobacco
	
pack
	purse 
	backpack
	bag
	pack
	knapsack
	rucksack
	
	
	


